su name reviewer round fromindex num 0 toindex num 0 be ceremony def
ob num of fromindex of this to name trying be plus do

ob name trying from num 1 be equally then ob name task to name text draft prompt be text do
ob name trying from num 1 be giant then ob text "Revise the candidate using reviewer feedback." to name text draft prompt be text do
ob name trying from num 1 be giant then ob text "\n\nTASK:\n" to name text draft prompt be plus do
ob name trying from num 1 be giant then ob name task to name text draft prompt be plus do
ob name trying from num 1 be giant then ob text "\n\nPRIOR CANDIDATE:\n" to name text draft prompt be plus do
ob name trying from num 1 be giant then ob name sketch to name text draft prompt be plus do
ob name trying from num 1 be giant then ob text "\n\nREVIEW FEEDBACK:\n" to name text draft prompt be plus do
ob name trying from num 1 be giant then ob name reaction to name text draft prompt be plus do

ob name using tools from num 1 be equally then ob text of ob of draft prompt for name author with name tools map to name text sketch be evoke do
ob name using tools from num 1 be tiny then ob text of ob of draft prompt for name author to name text sketch be evoke do

ob text "Review factual grounding and constraint fit. Return concise reasoning. Last non-empty line must be PASS or FAIL only." to name text review prompt be text do
ob text "\n\nTASK:\n" to name text review prompt be plus do
ob name task to name text review prompt be plus do
ob text "\n\nCANDIDATE:\n" to name text review prompt be plus do
ob name sketch to name text review prompt be plus do

ob name using tools from num 1 be equally then ob text of ob of review prompt for name reviewer with name tools map to name text reaction be evoke do
ob name using tools from num 1 be tiny then ob text of ob of review prompt for name reviewer to name text reaction be evoke do

ob name reaction atmost num 1 to name text decision line be line tail do
ob name decision line from text "/^\\s*PASS\\b/i" be resemble then be depart do
prah

su name reviewer trying by name text judge target for name text generator target ob name text task to name text output atleast num 0 atmost num 0 be ceremony def
ob name task to name text task be text do
ob num of atmost of this to name num attempts be plus do
ob num 0 to name num using tools be plus do
ob text "" to name text tools map be text do
ob text "" to name text sketch be text do
ob text "" to name text reaction be text do
ob text "" to name text decision line be text do
fromindex num 1 toindex num of ob of attempts be reviewer round do
ob text "FAIL" to name text review loop verdict be text do
ob name decision line from text "/^\\s*PASS\\b/i" be resemble then ob text "PASS" to name text review loop verdict be text do
ob name sketch to name text output be text do
su name output ret
prah

